      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim nɛmɛ bä lö Kuothdä, kɛ kui̱dä, kä nyuth ni ɣä gɔɔydu ce̱tnikɛ nhökdu min thil pek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k kuën kɛ jur",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ bä cua̱ ji̱ Juudh nɛn cikɛ kuɛɛn kɛ nyier ji̱ Ac-dod kɛnɛ ji̱ Am-on kɛ ji̱ Mo-ab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä tha̱a̱ŋ gankiɛn ruackɛ kɛ thok ji̱ Ac-dod kɛnɛ thuk nɛɛni tin kɔ̱ŋ, kui̱c kɛn ruac kɛ thok ji̱ Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua̱ kɛ bɛl, kä cua̱ kɛ lam, kä cua̱ tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn duäc, kä cua̱ mi̱emkiɛn yut. Cua̱ kɛ jak kä yackɛ rɔ̱ kɛ ciöt Kuɔth jiökä kɛ i̱, “/Cia nyieekun bi kuën gaatkiɛn, kä /cia nyieekiɛn bi kuën gaatkun kiɛ pua̱nykun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ciɛ kuën mään ɛ nëë jak kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Thɔ-lo-mon kä dui̱r? Kä thilɛ kuäär mi päär kɛ jɛ rɛy dööri ti ŋuan, kä nhɔk Kuothdɛ jɛ, kä cu Kuoth ɛ jak kä kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw. Kä cu män tin jur jɛ jak kä dui̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ kɔn bakɔ ku guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni ta̱a̱dun kɛ lätni dui̱rä mi ce̱tkɛ nɛ kä Kuothda kɛ kuën mään ti jur?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
